Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以从去年五月那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we could begin with your earliest recollections
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你最早的回忆开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the events of last May.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我第一次被牵扯进去是15号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I first got involved on the 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以把麦克风挪近一点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you move the microphone a little closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次被牵扯进去是15号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I first got involved on the 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,总理汤姆·皮克林捍卫着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Tom Pickering has defended
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,政府在残废抚恤金一事上的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the government's stance on disability benefits
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时 “轮椅殉道者”格温·马里布之死引发了公众强烈的愤慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as outrage over the death of so-called "Wheelchair Martyr" Gwen Marbury grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,超过两万民众签署了请愿书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than 20,000 people have signed a petition
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要求解雇新闻评论员乔·鲍尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}demanding the sacking of newspaper columnist Jo Powers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,源于她此前撰写了一篇关于格温·马里布的争议性文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}following her controversial article about Gwen Marbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,自然资源保护论者宣布又一物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conservationists have announced another extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,西伯利亚白鹤已灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Siberian crane has died out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,由于空前的湿地栖息地减少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}following an unprecedented reduction in its wetland habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一种名为人工智能蜂的模拟昆虫无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the honeybee-mimicking drone insects known as ADIs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,已经被激活 准备迎接他们的第二个夏季\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been activated for their second summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你为自己感到羞耻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you're ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贱人 - 这都是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bitch. - Pleasure's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,由·鲍尔斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,乔·鲍尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jo Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,里面的东西 会爆炸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever's in there, will it detonate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是面包店寄来给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's from bakery. For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真有创意 你的祝福者们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creative, your well-wishers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个蛋糕 蛋糕就该被吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cake. That's its job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我去洗个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to have a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 起航远行 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Sail away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 去远航 去远航 去远航 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Sail away, sail away, sail away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从比绍 到帕劳 阿瓦隆外的海角 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ From Bissau to Palau in the shade of Avalon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从斐济 到泰里 和伊博尼的岛 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ From Fiji to Tiree and the Isles of Ebony ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从秘鲁 到宿务 巴比伦人的旅途 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ From Peru to Cebu, hear the power of Babylon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从巴厘 到卡利 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ From Bali to Cali ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,格莱美奖获得者 说唱歌手塔斯克 仍在现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grammy-award-winning rapper Tusk is still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 塔斯克 网络上有许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Tusk, there are loads of online videos
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,人们试图去模仿你的视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of people trying to emulate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个是我们的最爱  请看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this is our favourite. Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这个年轻人名叫亚伦·希恩  他今年九岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a young chap called Aaron Sheen. He's nine years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.33,0:07:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个蠢孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one goofy-looking kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,跳得不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他才九岁 别这样  他跳得很好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's nine years old! Come on, he's a pretty good dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这小杂种根本不会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That young motherfucker can't dance for shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 他应该快点放弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should probably just give up now, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别因为我说了真话就恨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hate on me for keeping it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这傻狍子样的小杂种 根本不会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a goofy little motherfucker, and he can't dance for shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的铁杆粉丝 塔斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a big fan, Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别恨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hate on your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有刚开始的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's got to start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始的时候  我比他看上去好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start somewhere? I looked better than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是帕克督查员吗 - 不接受采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- DCI Parke? - No press.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不是媒体 呃 技术资料中心 布鲁·科尔森  我是你的搭档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not press. Um... TDC Blue Colson. I’m your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的搭档吗  他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My shadow? They said...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  请叫我卡琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Call me Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是说你的名字叫 - 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you say your name was...? - Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- B-l-u-e 布鲁 - 嗯 不是绰号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- B-l-u-e, Blue? - Yeah. It's not a nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爸爸喜欢这名字的发音 - 嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My dad liked the sound of it. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你以前见过尸体吗 - 见过一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seen a body before? - A couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在录像里见过 - 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On video, I mean. - Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是布鲁  我的搭档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Blue. She's my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是尼克·谢尔顿警长 - 发现了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- DS Nick Shelton. - What've we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔·鲍里斯 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jo Powers. - As in...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个乔·鲍里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in actual Jo Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我看过她写的关于坐轮椅的女人的文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saw something she wrote the other day about the wheelchair woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,骗点击的东西  把人们惹恼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clickbait piece. Pissed people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那篇文章太可怕了  我也签了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That article was fucking horrendous. Even I signed the petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要求解雇她的请愿书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get her sacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,邻居听到了她的尖叫 叫来了警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neighbours heard her screaming and called it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,挣扎得很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell of a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他人在家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她的丈夫  胃部被深砍了一刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Husband. Found slashed across the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她砍的吗 - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- By her? - Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在昏迷中  我们将他送到圣哥伦比亚医院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was unconscious. They've taken him to St. Columbus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她的推特提醒源源不断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her mentions are still pouring in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,窗是锁好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restraining bolt's in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有其他入口吗 - 没有  但外面一圈都有闭路电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No other points of entry? - No. But the outside's ringed with CCTV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们有监控的控制码吗 - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got the code for the cams? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那么  检查录像  把蛋糕打包拿去毒物学测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then. Check the recordings. Bag that, send it to Toxicology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,全套尸检 等她丈夫醒过来就询问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full autop for her, and we question the husband as soon as he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认为是她丈夫做的吗 - 我还不能肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think it's the husband? - I'm keeping options open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,割喉 这很不寻常  谢谢 小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cutting the throat, that's unusual. Thanks, chaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但你认为是他做的 - 现在还什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you do think he did it? - Don't know anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事常常是源于饮酒 嗑药 和家庭纠纷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are almost always either drink, drugs or domestic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你开车回家吗 - 我没有驾照  从没通过考试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You driving home? - No licence. Never passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等无人驾驶变成主流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sort of waiting for driverless to go mainstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.81,0:11:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上车吧 - 不 老实说 我坐地铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in. - No, honestly, I'll get the Tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上车 - 噢 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in. - Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在科技犯罪部门吗 - 数字取证  电脑上的黑暗事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you were in Tech Crime? - Digital Forensics. Computer murk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你觉得无聊了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened, you get bored of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是  你会看见人们试图藏起的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly. You've seen what people tuck away on these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,阴谋 死亡名单 儿童色情电影  一点都不无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Schemes and kill lists, kiddy porn. It's not boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻的时候 还没有电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm old enough to remember when they walked around with that stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,人们只是想想这些事情而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just tucked away in their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  但现在他们忍不住要把这些和小伙伴分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. But now they can't help butentrusting it to their little companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 网络 这些东西吸收了我们的人格  它们知晓我们的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things absorb who we are. They know everything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果觉得有趣 为什么要离开取证部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's interesting, why leave Forensics?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.59,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,兰诺克案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Rannoch case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伊恩·兰诺克吗 - 对 那个杀害儿童的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ian Rannoch? - The child killings, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是我破解了他的纪念文件夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the one who cracked his souvenir folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到了那些照片 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you saw those pictures? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有视频  全看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the videos too. Saw them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当你看到那种东西 你会被改变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see something like that, it changes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要么受到严重的打击 要么你会想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You either get defeated or you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你会想 “我靠  我得帮忙阻止这种事”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think, "Fuck me! I've got to help stop that shit."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是说 在现场的话 - 什么现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, out here in the field... - What fucking field?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的啊  在现实世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean. Out here in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以真正地阻止事情发生 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can genuinely prevent stuff, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你太年轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是你老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天见 - 好的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you tomorrow. - Yes, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,乔·鲍里斯死于她位于西伦敦的家中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jo Powers has been found dead at her home in West London.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这位资深专栏作家 生前撰写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The veteran columnist had been at the centre of controversy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:14:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,关于残障权益运动者格温·马布里的文章 引发了巨大争议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over an article she'd written about disability rights activist Gwen Marbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,警方正在调查死亡原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police have yet to confirm the cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是第一层 第一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just the first floor, first door on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这么早就开始工作了吗 - 我让尼克给我看闭路电视的录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Starting early? - I asked Nick to show me the CCTV.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没人进出  整晚屋里都只有乔和她的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one came in or out. Just Jo and her husband all evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个是什么 - 后面的露天庭院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that one there? - Rear patio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看这样子 似乎是几个月前被破坏的 - 可能有人从那里进了屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bust for months by the looks of it. - Someone could've come in through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那必须翻过围墙进出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd have to climb the fence, make it in and out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而且知道那里的摄像机不在摄录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing the camera wasn't working,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 技术上来说 可能会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but yeah, could have happened. Technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你很热心帮忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're keen to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是她来问我的 - 嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She just asked! - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... So...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在整理过去48小时内针对乔·鲍尔斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm collating every threat or insult levelled at Jo Powers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,恐吓和侮辱言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the previous 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,假设真是他老公  那也太巧合了 不是么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it is the husband. That's a coincidence, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不全是  你这样搞得我们很苦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really. You've got everyone throwing a shit fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们家承受的精神压力极大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stress levels in that household would've been through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,网络舆论风向就像天气瞬息万变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Internet stuff drifts off like weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:16:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是真的憎恨  他们不过是随口一说  但夫妻之间的恨意 是很现实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's half hate. They don't mean it. The hate in a marriage, that's in 3D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一种发自肺腑 刻骨铭心的恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's had work put into it. That's sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对  我离过婚 - 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. I'm divorced. - Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫醒了可以说话了  他的供述妙极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Husband's up and talking. You're gonna love his alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到乔在楼上的尖叫声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard Jo screaming from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当我冲过去的时候 她在房间里跌跌撞撞地乱晃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I ran in, she was walking 'round the room, stumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她紧紧地 紧紧地抱着头好像很痛苦的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was clutching... She was clutching her head as if she was in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,然后突然 她就停下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then for a moment, she stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就好像癫痫发作似的 她就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then it was like a seizure, she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,开始打 抓自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thrashing... clawing at her own skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她转向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she turned...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她一头撞在了 书桌上 很用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She smashed her head... onto the desk, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她 一把把我推开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she... she pushed me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,估计玻璃瓶就是那时被砸碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must've been when the bottle smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她捡起了玻璃碎片 开始往自己身上划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she picked it up, and she started cutting herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就这里  她一直在挖这块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. She was gouging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我试图阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但她还是不停地伤害自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她就割喉自尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she cut her throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我试图阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她用玻璃割断了自己的喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cut her own throat with the glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,先自残再自杀 却没有明显理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutilated and then killed herself for no apparent reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说 这可能性也太小了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say the odds are against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他说 她像是癫痫发作一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it was like she was having a seizure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是那蛋糕有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe there was something in the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕 - 上面用糖霜写了“死婊子”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The cake? - It had "fucking bitch" iced on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许是里面有什么东西 - 类似下药吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could've been something in it. - Like a drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 会让人自杀的药吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - That makes people kill themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他的话听起来挺令人信服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was sort of convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他看起来并不 - 别说“像杀人犯”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He just doesn't seem the... - Don't say "the type."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他很普通  普通人也有可能是杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's ordinary. That is the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 所以是他把妻子的头狠狠撞向书桌的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, so he bounced her head off the desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布鲁 - 把她抓得紧紧地 足以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blue. - Held her steady enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布鲁 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blue. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕已经被送去药检了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Toxicology are looking at the cake. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去调查下送蛋糕的人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meantime, let's drop in on the person that sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,今早我查到名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got the name this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不用这么故意迎合我 - 我们在依你行事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't need to patronize me. - We're doing what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟进另一条线索 - 但你觉得这是浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Following another lead. - That you think is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,死胡同也得走一遍才能证明是真的走不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picking along dead ends just to prove they're dead ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,干这行就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's most of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说这是浪费时间  只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying it's a waste of time. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没有感受到现实的无趣呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you haven't had a chance to get bored of reality yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我刚刚是有点傲慢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that was patronizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是送蛋糕的人吗 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this who sent the cake? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你调查过她的社交账号吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have we checked her social feeds? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,“去死吧乔·鲍尔特”  这是她周一早晨发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Death to Jo Powers." She posted that on Monday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,面包店说他们本不想做这种带脏话的蛋糕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bakery said that they're not meant to do obscenities,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉他们 这是给我姐姐的 开玩笑而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I said it was for my sister, like just a joke thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they agreed, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不便宜啊 他们的蛋糕  算上运费 大概是80英镑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not cheap, their cakes. With delivery, it was what, 80 quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 钱也不是我一个人付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... Well, I didn't pay for it all myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们每个人付了一英镑 - 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all put a pound in each. - We?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我在一个妈妈和保姆的论坛里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm on a mums and carers message board.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,发起了集资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I held a sort of whip-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以这钱是众筹的 - 嗯 如果你想这么说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You crowd-sourced the money? - Yeah, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,从其他80人那里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From 80 other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在开玩笑 好吗  我知道她已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not being funny, okay? I know she is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但你读过她写的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you read what she had written?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得她写的那坨屁话 为她赚了多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you think she got paid for spouting that horrible shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的言论自由权 - 用来恐吓他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was just using my freedom of speech. - To send a threatening message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只是好玩 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was funny, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道如果这蛋糕是我一个人买的话 就有点奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can see if I'd done it myself, then that would be a bit weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm not mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾希望她去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wished she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- “去死吧乔·鲍尔特” - 那只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Death to Jo Powers." - That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是带话题炒热度而已  写上“去死吧”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a... a hashtag game, you know, like "Death to..."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,后面加上某个混蛋的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You insert the name of someone who's being an arsehole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是 真的  只是开个玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not... real. It's a joke thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谁发起的呢  那个话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who started it? The hashtag?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  我不知道  我只是正好看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't know. I saw it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,药检结果出来了 蛋糕没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toxicology say the cake's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还说 “谢谢了 蛮好吃的”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They also said:"Thanks, it was delicious."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们给她个警告吧  涉嫌违反电讯法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll give her a caution. Offensive Communications Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕的事就这么过去了吗 - 至少对她而言 是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does that cover cakes? - As far as she's concerned, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那参与众筹的其他人呢  你也要去警告他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the others who chipped in? Are you going to tell them off, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么都没做 - 是你开的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't do anything. - Start a thread about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫明天就能出院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hospital's discharging the husband tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会传讯审问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll bring him in for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.55,0:22:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁  我们会逮捕丈夫  别再对这事耿耿于怀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue? We're arresting the husband. Don't wallow in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,互联网上今天又会转移话题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Internet will be pissed off with someone else today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:22:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,图斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在成了众矢之的 因为骂那小孩的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's pissed off with Tusk 'cause of that thing with the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他这事可是席卷各大社交网络啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's catching a shit storm on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.41,0:23:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丽莎又会组织大家买蛋糕了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Liza will be organising the cake now. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天见 - 明天见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you tomorrow. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮小姐姐在哪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where my ladies at?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟  演出不错啊 - 那不是 好极了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo! Good show. - Yeah, that's a good show, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的要上天了 - 想来一口吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm feeling my shit. - You want some of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你抽什么呢 - 好东西 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you smoking? - Good shit, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A'ight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,监控 监控 监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on, eyes on, eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.83,0:23:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张  这儿合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stress. It's legal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,呸  记性不好  欧洲欢迎你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pfft! Keep forgetting. Welcome to Europe, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞得我没劲了 - 可不是么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kinda takes the joy out of it. - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点  你搞坏了要赔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful! You break it, you pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.86,0:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,总是瞎搞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always doing some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,图斯克  图斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tusk? Tusk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.53,0:24:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哟哟  谁来帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, yo! We need some help over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在这呢 - 把它搞出来  把它搞出来  把它搞出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got you. - Get it out! Get it out! Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说是什么事了吗 - 没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did he say what it is? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.95,0:27:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体在这里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.94,0:27:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我顺着伤口深入后发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I go in,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不止是玻璃划出的伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's not just the wound from the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有个洞  凹槽  一个钻孔 就像一个小隧道一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a hole. Dug in. A bore hole, like a tiny tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我顺着深入 你知道有多深吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I follow it, you know, how deep does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从耳道直深入大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It goes all the way from her ear canal to deep in her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是在她脑内发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就停在大脑内  看起来还蛮舒适的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nestled right in there. Looks quite cosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.73,0:28:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是那种像蜜蜂似的机器人 - 人工智能蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's one of those bee things. - An ADI.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.44,0:28:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,颗粒企划公司制造的自控昆虫机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Autonomous Drone Insect from the Granular Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它是怎么进去的呢 - 我想是自己凿洞进去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did it get in there? - I'd say it burrowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.52,0:28:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卧槽 - 这还不是最可怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fuck me. - That's not the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它在后脑岛里钻了个洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It crawled right through her dorsal posterior insula,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.44,0:28:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是大脑掌控痛觉的区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is basically the brain's pain centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.50,0:28:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这种疼痛是常人无法承受的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking agony off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.50,0:28:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了停止疼痛你会不惜一切代价 - 即使是割喉自刎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'd do anything to make it stop. - Even cut your own throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.59,0:28:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下午好 - 我是帕克探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good afternoon. - DCI Parke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.04,0:28:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是实习探员布鲁·科尔森 - 好的  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- TDC Blue Colson. - Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.34,0:29:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这些公司看起来真是光鲜得不得了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're so fucking fancy-looking, these companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 砸了几亿镑树立品牌 - 好吧 他们有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Billions on branding. - Well, they can afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,整个人工智能蜂项目都是有政府资助的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole ADI project's pretty much bankrolled by the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.58,0:29:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以弄得人心惶惶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why so many people are paranoid about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.66,0:29:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你是说的某些网友吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess, this is some people on the Internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.86,0:29:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们认为政府用这些蜜蜂来监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They reckon the government uses the bees to spy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.34,0:29:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,病态的世界观啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a schizophrenic world view.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 我可从来没想过能活在未来世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, I didn't expect to find myself living in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.90,0:29:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但我现在竟然就穿越来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but here I fucking well am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.03,0:30:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是卡琳·帕克吗 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Karin Parke? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.19,0:30:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瓦内萨·达尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vanessa Dahl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.76,0:30:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们来是想询问我们的人工智能蜂项目的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're after information on our Project Swarm ADIs?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.74,0:30:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么特殊原因吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any particular reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.53,0:30:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斯马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rasmus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.54,0:30:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斯马斯·斯乔伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rasmus Sjoberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是这个项目的领头人 - 很高兴认识你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He heads Swarm. - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.40,0:30:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.64,0:31:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 温室不错 - 对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice greenhouse. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.86,0:31:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你的蜜蜂 你的人工智能蜂 可以给我介绍一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, your bees, your ADIs,talk me through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.31,0:31:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂群崩溃失调症 我们还不知道原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colony Collapse Disorder. We still don't know what's behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.47,0:31:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂已经差不多灭绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bees themselves were virtually extinct
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人工智能蜂就起到了代替它们的功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so what our ADIs do is effectively stand in for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.78,0:31:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是太阳能的  他们不需要采蜜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're solar powered. They don't need nectar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.34,0:31:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但它们一样可以传播花粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they pollinate flowers the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,它们爬进花中 花粉就会黏在它们腿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They crawl inside, pollen sticks to their legs
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.42,0:31:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,它们再飞到下一朵花上抖落花粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gets brushed off the next flower they visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.57,0:31:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们可以生产蜂蜜么 - 呃 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can they make honey? - Uh... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.44,0:31:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只是开个玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.21,0:31:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它们怎么知道花在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do they know where the flowers even are? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 它们有传感器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they have a sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,像摄像头一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a... camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.67,0:31:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  只是基础的视觉传感器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Just a basic visual sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.99,0:31:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,它们需要基本的图像识别功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, they need rudimentary pattern recognition
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才能定位可兼容的植物群并导航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to locate compatible flora and navigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们可以导航吗 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They navigate? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.90,0:31:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不 我不懂 操控它们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't... I don't know... steer them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.64,0:32:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是自动的  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're autonomous. That's right, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.26,0:32:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,它们自己决定该干什么  它们自己照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They make their own decisions. They look after themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.06,0:32:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对  人工智能蜂遍布全英\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You see, the ADIs cover the whole of the UK.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.21,0:32:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有办法分别控制每一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't command each one individually ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.88,0:32:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,逻辑上来说这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just not logistically possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.55,0:32:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我们只是设定行为模式 让它们自己运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We simply set the behaviour and leave them to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.66,0:32:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它们甚至可以自己建蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hey even construct these hives themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会自我繁殖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They reproduce...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.43,0:32:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们自我繁殖 - 是的  每一个蜂巢都有复制点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They reproduce? - Yes. Each hive is a replication point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有点像3D打印机 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like a 3D printer, basically. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.07,0:32:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,它们自己生产自己的复制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They create duplicates of themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.56,0:32:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,建造更多的蜂巢 以指数级速度扩散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}create more hives and spread out exponentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.45,0:32:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 覆盖全国 - 也许你应该来这儿工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cover the country. - Maybe you should work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.58,0:32:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我读过这方面的文章  真了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I read up on it. It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.17,0:32:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  存在这样的必要性也是蛮让人羞愧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is. It's just a shame it's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不然会产生环境灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The alternative would have been environmental catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.78,0:32:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂正在灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bees were dying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 什么风把你们吹到这儿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is it that brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为你的一只人工智能蜂和一起不明死亡有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think one of your ADIs may be involved in an unexplained death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思  死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry? A death?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:32:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.57,0:33:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.63,0:33:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  这是我们的  可是 他们不是被设计来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's one of ours. But, look, these are not designed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人吗  我也希望不是  是不是发生了什么故障呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill people? I'd hope not. Could it have malfunctioned somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.29,0:33:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的  当它们发生故障的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I mean, when they do malfunction...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这有时候会发生 但是它们会直接坏掉 掉在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens, but then they just break, they just hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.66,0:33:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有没可能是有人黑进了一只自控昆虫机器人 并找到了控制的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if someone hacked one and then they found a way of controlling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.38,0:33:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.74,0:33:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它的加密技术是军用级别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it's got military-grade encryption,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.79,0:33:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你还需要诊断控制器 那个也是加密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you would need a diagnostic controller, which is also encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.94,0:33:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我认为这种可能性是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I would say the likelihood is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不懂他在说什么 但听起来也不是完全不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what he's saying, but it's not the same as "impossible."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们线上的每一个蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is every hive we have online.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.29,0:34:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是这栋楼里的蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the hives in the building here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.82,0:34:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个蜂巢里有多少只蜜蜂 - 大约4000只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many bees per hive? - Around 4,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.09,0:34:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看起来有点像交通管制 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like air traffic control. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.85,0:34:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是搜索框吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the search input?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.58,0:34:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 但是 呃 你需要 - 不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but, uh... you'd need... - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.38,0:34:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,乔·鲍尔斯的邮编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jo Powers' postcode.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.79,0:34:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了她的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that who this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.34,0:34:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚说有一些会出故障 - 很少的一部分 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said you get some malfunctions? - A fair few, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.26,0:34:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它们可能会撞到车上  有一些会被人们抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They smack into a car or something. We even had people trap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.68,0:34:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把它们放进微波炉里拍YouTube视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, put them in the microwave for YouTube videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.58,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而这个系统会记录所有的故障情况吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this logs any that drop off the system?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.38,0:34:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都记录 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logs everything, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,周一晚上这附近有没有蜜蜂掉线呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you lose any around here on Monday evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.01,0:34:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我查查看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.99,0:35:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一只  在19:03左右掉线  我可以回放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one. Went out at 1903 hours. Here, I can replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.34,0:35:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.37,0:35:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就奇怪了 - 什么奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's odd. - What's odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.00,0:35:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当它们在蜂巢之间移动时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they pass between hives,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.49,0:35:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的管辖权也会在蜂巢之间交换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they switch from one jurisdiction to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这有点像 - 有点像信号发射塔之间的电话信号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's, you know, like a...- It's like a phone between cell masts?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.08,0:35:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,正解  它想这么做 但没有蜂巢愿意接收它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. It tried to do that, but there was nothing to switch to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.84,0:35:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,除非有人伪造了一个蜂巢并用此控制你的蜜蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless someone spoofed a hive and then they've used that to commandeer your ADI.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你还需要一个诊断控制器才能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you would need a diagnostic controller to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.62,0:35:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,控制器的使用范围是多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the range on one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.40,0:35:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,10到20米 大概\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten, 20 metres, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.26,0:35:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管是谁在控制这个 他一定要在20米范围之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whoever was controlling it would have to be no more than 20 metres away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.38,0:35:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就在房子外面 - 是的  甚至就在一辆车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Outside the house. - Yeah. Sitting in a car, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可以追踪到是谁干的吗 - 是的  我已经开始查了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you trace back who did this? - Yes. I-I'm already trying to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.76,0:35:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  我一个人可能会追踪得更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Uh...It would be easier without an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.86,0:36:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.22,0:36:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个交换一下号码 保持联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two swap numbers, keep a line of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.42,0:36:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果需要的话 你可以关闭整个系统吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you shut the whole thing down if need be... hypothetically speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.68,0:36:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是短暂的停止 都会对整个生态系统造成破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even a short stoppage would damage the ecosystem,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.54,0:36:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们还需要环保部的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'd need approval from the Department of the Environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.00,0:36:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要有系统权限的所有颗粒企划公司的员工名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need a list of any Granular staff that had access to that system,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.73,0:36:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在职的和离职的都要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}past or present.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.70,0:36:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有一些是政府雇员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some were government employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.91,0:36:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有帮助的话 用不同的字体把他们标出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use a different font for those if it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.45,0:36:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.03,0:37:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 这是颗粒企划公司的人事记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, that's a set of Granular personnel records.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.39,0:37:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找出任何有嫌疑的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Root out anyone interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.74,0:37:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不止一个  有可能是团伙犯案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not just one. Could be a group involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.58,0:37:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我们应该上报给国家犯罪局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically we should refer this up to the NCA,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们休想从我这里抢走这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's no fucking way they're taking this off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,国家犯罪局已经知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The NCA already knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.82,0:37:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.95,0:37:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你是卡琳·帕克探员吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DCI Karin Parke?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.76,0:37:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我是肖恩·李  国家犯罪局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Shaun Li, National Crime Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.33,0:37:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.82,0:37:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况不止一例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.14,0:37:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是图克斯 昨晚的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Tusk, last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.27,0:37:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 他们以为他只是突发痉挛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - They thought it was a fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.18,0:37:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把他送去了医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took him to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.42,0:37:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为了防止他伤害自己 他们给他打了麻醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had to be anaesthetised to stop him mutilating himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,X光显示他的脑部有一处淤血或者肿瘤之类的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X-ray seemed to indicate some kind of plaque or tumour in his brain
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.82,0:37:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就给他做了核磁共振\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they popped him in the MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.58,0:38:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊  其实就是一个大磁铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Basically one big magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,撕开他的眼窝 把这个直接吸了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tore it right out of his head, through the eye socket.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也弄坏了这只人工智能蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battered the ADI too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.95,0:38:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的那只更完整 我需要拿去分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours is more intact so I'm gonna need it for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,两起命案就形成模式了  意味着不是由于系统故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two's a pattern. It knocks any malfunction theory in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且受害者的情况都相似 - 相似\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And they're similar victims. - Similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,两人都是网络讨伐的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both in the middle of online shit storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想除掉一个人 不是有无数种更简单的方法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you wanna kill someone, there's a million easier ways to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.28,0:38:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个的话 你隔着一条街都能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull this off and you've done it from across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.78,0:38:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不会留下指纹和DNA  就像把他们咒死了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fingerprints, no DNA. It's like wishing them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.78,0:38:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.45,0:38:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.48,0:39:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙  过来一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好 所以 乔·鲍尔斯和图斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so, um... Jo Powers and Tusk,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.97,0:39:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,两人都被网民们谩骂了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both were being kicked around the Internet for hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但在这两个人的案子中 人们都把他们的照片和一个话题标签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but in both their cases, people were also tweeting their photos
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.79,0:39:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,“去死吧”一起转发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accompanied with this hashtag: #DeathTo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.37,0:39:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像那个老师一样 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like our friend the teacher. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.87,0:39:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她不知道最初是从哪里看到这个标签的 但是往前追溯的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't know where she'd first heard of it, but trace it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.14,0:39:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来第一次有人使用这个话题标签 是在上周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it looks like the first real use of the hashtag was last weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.66,0:39:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是谁 - 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- By who? - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.26,0:39:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是一堆僵尸号发了一模一样的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like identical tweets from a set of duplicate bot accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.28,0:39:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.56,0:39:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,自动的  有点像垃圾邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Automated. It's like spam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.65,0:39:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想推广这个标签 懂吗  就用这种办法来推广它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is someone trying to seed the tag, you know? Get it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.85,0:39:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,像个诱饵  有人希望人们开始使用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like bait. This is someone wanting people to pick up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.42,0:40:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个发送者的头像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out the senders' avatar photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.66,0:40:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂  该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bees. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.18,0:40:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.34,0:40:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每条推文都附带了一个说明视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So each tweet had a sort of instruction video attached to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.24,0:40:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯嗯 - 这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh-huh. - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.05,0:40:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,“报应游戏”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Game of Consequences"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像讨厌度竞赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like an unpopularity contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.55,0:40:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,选一个你不喜欢的人 如果足够多的人选择同一个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick someone you don't like and if enough other people choose the same name,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.23,0:40:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人就会成为目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then that's who gets targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.29,0:40:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.05,0:40:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,报应游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game of Consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.64,0:40:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一 选择一个目标 - 噢 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One: Pick a target. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.48,0:40:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,二 发送他们的照片和名字 并带上“去死吧”的标签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two: Post their name and photo with #DeathTo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.02,0:40:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,三 每天被提到最多的人 会在下午5点后被清除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three: Most popular target will be eliminated after 5 p.m. each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.98,0:40:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,四 游戏会在午夜重新计数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four: Game resets at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.20,0:40:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 不 - 操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.89,0:40:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在进行一个公开投票 来杀掉票数最多的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's holding a public ballot, bumping off the top person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.78,0:41:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 太疯狂了 - 是的 而且参与的人越来越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus, it's just mad. - Yeah, and it's growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.76,0:41:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,第一天  63个人对乔·鲍尔斯使用了那个话题标签 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day one. 63 people used the hashtag on Jo Powers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.58,0:41:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天 223个人对图斯克使用了那个标签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On day two, 223 used it on Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在谁在用 - 现在 现在人更多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's using it now? - There's... There's loads more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.23,0:41:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有不少人对财政大臣在用那个话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's quite a few votes for the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.20,0:41:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.75,0:41:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但排第一位的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at number one...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.95,0:41:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有880人将标签用在了克莱拉·米德斯的身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is 880 people using it on someone called Clara Meades.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.22,0:41:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是谁 - 克莱拉·米德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's she? - Clara Meades.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.27,0:41:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 她好像在演示什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, um... it looks like she was at a demo,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.43,0:41:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她在一座战争纪念碑前自拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she took a selfie in front of a war memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.32,0:41:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 假装要向上面撒尿 - 干得漂亮 克莱拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pretending to piss on it.  - Nice work, Clara.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.42,0:41:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 离投票结束越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's getting near the end of the vote,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.93,0:41:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,提到她的也越来越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her mentions are blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 图斯克的事公众还不知道吗 - 呃 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tusk isn't public knowledge yet? - Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.20,0:41:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以大家并不知道这个标签的作用  他们就是想吓唬她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So people can't know the hashtag works. They're using it to scare her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.87,0:41:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 但他们会害死她 - 我们需要在五点前找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but they're gonna get her killed. - We need to get to her before five.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.70,0:41:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好  查看她的市民信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Pulling her citizens details.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.76,0:42:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有权限查看那些信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not supposed to have access to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.49,0:42:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我知道  我只是为了找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. Just getting her location.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.01,0:42:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.46,0:42:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.56,0:42:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 她在  好的 好的 稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she is. All right, all right, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.68,0:42:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.24,0:43:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,警察  找你的  他们怎么知道我电话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police. For you. How did they get my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.72,0:43:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 克莱拉·米德斯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Clara Meades?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.45,0:43:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是伦敦警察厅的探员卡琳·帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is DCI Karin Parke, Met Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.44,0:43:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉这样找到你 但我们认为你可能有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to track you down like this, but we think you may be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.98,0:43:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 这是玩笑吗  因为目前我收到的这些东西都不好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, is this a joke? Because all this stuff I'm getting is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.18,0:43:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑  在我们来之前哪儿也别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not joking. Stay where you are until we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,关上窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep your windows closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.34,0:43:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经派人拉起了警戒线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm setting up a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.72,0:43:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,打给拉斯马斯 我们需要他帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call Rasmus, we need him across this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.22,0:43:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉斯马斯吗 - 你好 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rasmus? - Hi, Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.54,0:43:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你发一个邮编 还有我的GPS定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sending you a postcode and my GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.99,0:43:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你来监视这个地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to monitor the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.56,0:43:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,持续跟踪我的位置 看看有没有异常 有没有下线的人工智能蜂 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track my location and see if you get anything unusual, any rogue ADIs, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.13,0:43:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, great, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.09,0:43:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果他们又犯案了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if they come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.40,0:43:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我能抓住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.79,0:43:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我设置了一个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have basically set a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.77,0:43:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们 如果他们再次犯案 我们能抓到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if they... if they try it again, we've got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.27,0:44:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是蝙蝠侠吗 - 这是新推出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you Batman? - They only just rolled them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.87,0:44:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可以把从这儿到那儿的所有红灯变成绿灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This'll turn every red light between here and there to green.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠  如果这就是国家犯罪局的日常 我真该申请调岗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me. If this is the NCA life, I should apply for a transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.99,0:44:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.78,0:44:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以带她到这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can take her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.26,0:44:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,通常情况下 这房子是给恐怖活动的线人准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a safe house for terrorist informers usually.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.59,0:44:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No target sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.76,0:44:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是警方行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a police operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.38,0:44:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 请立即离开屋内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody vacate their premises now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,请离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.62,0:45:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 有人想黑进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - Someone's trying to break in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.46,0:45:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉斯马斯 - 我刚找到一个恶意攻击入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rasmus? - I just picked up an attempted breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.33,0:45:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是颗粒企划公司 他们找到一个恶意攻击入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granular, they've got a breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.09,0:45:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一只人工智能蜂刚刚下线了  - 在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One ADI just went offline. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.36,0:45:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 距离你800米 - 在我们的封锁线外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 800 metres from your location. - That's outside our cordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.36,0:45:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人遥控蜜蜂向这边飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone's trying to pilot it this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.75,0:45:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看到这些穿警服的 也会立即掉头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're gonna turn 'round the moment they see all these uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.07,0:45:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉·米德斯吧  我是卡琳·帕克  你收拾好行李了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara Meades? I'm Karin Parke. Did you pack a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.52,0:45:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 都放在门边了 - 好 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it's by the door. - Right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.92,0:46:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉斯马斯找到他们了吗 - 还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rasmus got a track on them? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.80,0:47:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只是以防万一 过了今晚就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just precautionary, and it's only for one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.80,0:47:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我去向局里汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just gotta call in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.21,0:47:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没 还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.12,0:47:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可能永远不会  颗粒企划正在找呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully never. Granular are onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.94,0:47:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.74,0:48:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩说 他们曾让一个目击者在这儿住了一阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They housed a witness here for a while, Shaun said.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.91,0:48:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定有孩子 - 你们有孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Must've had kids. - Have you got kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.08,0:48:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.30,0:48:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没这计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.99,0:48:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.63,0:48:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉斯马斯 - 没有  还是没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rasmus. - Still nothing. I can't trace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.53,0:49:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,至少这是间套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least there's an en-suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.98,0:49:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么也没有吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there nothing? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是谁 他们把自己隐藏得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever it is, they've masked their path well.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.38,0:49:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但那不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.63,0:49:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 擦 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fuck. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.74,0:49:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一整个蜂巢都下线了 - 什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We just lost a whole hive. - What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.13,0:49:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,满载人工智能蜂的蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packed full of ADIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.46,0:49:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也全部下线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost them all too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.68,0:49:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 拉斯马斯 - 上千只蜜蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No... Rasmus? - There's thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.54,0:49:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿 - 离你很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - It's close to your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斯马斯 再说一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rasmus, say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.80,0:49:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁  布鲁  它离 它离你很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue? Blue. It's close... It's very close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.96,0:49:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,发信息  发信息给我  拉斯马斯  发信息给 靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Text it. Text it to me. Rasmus. Text it to... Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.54,0:49:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要再装修一次吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I get to redecorate?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.58,0:50:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.43,0:50:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.46,0:50:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们掌控了整个系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.33,0:50:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么也做不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not in control anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.40,0:50:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们掌控了整个系统 - 你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They've got the whole thing. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.05,0:50:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快修啊  你不能修好吗  - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fix it! Can't you fix it? - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.46,0:51:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,擦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.58,0:51:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了  现在  现在  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go. Now. Now! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.54,0:51:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,走  走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.50,0:51:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's... what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.61,0:51:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,卡琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karin...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.46,0:52:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,去里面  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.17,0:52:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我把门缝堵住 - 告诉我怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me block the gap! - Tell me what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.56,0:52:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们快把我吓屎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're scaring the shit out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.51,0:53:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  卧槽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.62,0:53:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,风扇  风扇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fan! The fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快把它赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.14,0:55:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.42,0:55:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前见过很多尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd seen so many bodies before.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.16,0:55:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在犯罪现场 解剖室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At crime scenes, in autopsies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.66,0:55:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但从没看过别人死在我的面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd never seen anyone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.31,0:55:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.86,0:55:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你能描述一下你同事 科尔森小姐的反应吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And can you describe the reaction of your colleague, Miss Colson?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.06,0:55:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁受到了很大打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue took it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.16,0:55:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把它关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.50,0:56:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之前认为这是一个人 附近的某个神秘先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought this was one guy, some Mr. Mystery in the vicinity,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.34,0:56:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,黑了一只人工智能蜂 并且亲自控制它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hijacking one ADI and personally controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.54,0:56:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这次有上千只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there were thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.46,0:56:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以推论不成立 对吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So it can't be that, right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.22,0:56:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个人不可能一次操作上千只 - 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One person can't fly hundreds at once. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.22,0:56:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是谁 他们肯定是控制了整个系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever this is, they're controlling the whole system.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.68,0:56:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 知道它在哪儿吗 - 哪儿都可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know where from? - Could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.04,0:56:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈得给我找出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to fucking sort this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.84,0:56:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,人工智能蜂怎么知道谁是目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do the ADIs know who to target?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.84,0:56:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,它们可能跟你一样 用身份数据库找到了克莱拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could've found Clara the same way you did, the identity database?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.25,0:56:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不  那样只能找到大致的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That just gives you the basic area.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.05,0:56:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时共处一室  但是它们只攻击她一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were in the room too, and they only went for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.41,0:56:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人脸识别  肯定是人脸识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Facial recognition. It's got to be facial recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.65,0:56:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说他们的视觉感应器 也被黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means the feed from their visual sensors, that's been accessed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.74,0:56:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 这是唯一的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not possible. - It's the only explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.51,0:57:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 每只蜜蜂和蜂巢的视觉数据流都受到了额外的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look, the visual feed is secure between each ADI and the hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.66,0:57:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说 - 虽然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go. - Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.85,0:57:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为政府支持这个项目的要求之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the government's conditions for backing the project...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.33,0:57:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.49,0:57:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不得不同意政府提供的安全服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to consent to permitting government security services
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.86,0:57:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让其可以控制我们的视觉数据流 正如条款中所说“保护国家安全”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}access to the visual feed at times of quote, "increased national security."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.42,0:57:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is, as I understand it, pretty much all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.26,0:57:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我当时很不愿意接受 - 但你还是同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wasn't happy about it. - Your lot went along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.35,0:57:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着你的生命中能有更多的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That implies a greater range of options than your lot presented.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.58,0:57:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以政府的确监视我们 - 这些都是保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So they are spying on us. - This is all classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.38,0:57:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那你做了什么 你是不是开了个后门 黑进了国家通信总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what did you do, did you put in a back door and route it through GCHQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.25,0:57:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是管理闭路电视 和公路监控摄像头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you do CCTV, you do traffic cams.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么东西是你没有染指的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what don't you have your fucking noses in?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,成千上万的智能蜂到处飞 就是为了支撑生态系统吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, millions of those things flying around, propping up the ecosystem?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.66,0:57:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好 真棒 拯救地球 哈利路亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's great, save the planet, hallelujah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.93,0:57:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,政府不会往里投十几亿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Government's not going to pump billions into it...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.53,0:57:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为一些科学家这么说 顺便赚200张环保者的支持票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just 'cause some lab coat says so, and it grabs 200 green votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们觉得有机会得到更多 他们就抓住了机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They saw an opportunity to get more, they took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.05,0:58:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,全国性的监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total nationwide surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.25,0:58:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用疑犯完全设想不到的方式 跟踪他们好几个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tracked suspects for weeks in ways they couldn't dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.06,0:58:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们阻止了爆炸 枪击 - 通过监视大众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We prevented bombings, mass shootings. - By spying on the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.57,0:58:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,保护他们的平安 这正是他们想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keeping them safe, which is what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.82,0:58:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但克莱拉·米德斯并不安全 是吧 肖恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara Meades isn't safe, though, is she, Shaun?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.18,0:58:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们你所知道的 可能会帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowing what you knew, that might've helped us,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.47,0:58:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但你却什么也没说 守住了你那些肮脏的小秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but no, you kept your little fucking secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.40,0:58:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  政府就是很婊  这大家早就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! The government's a cunt. We knew that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.49,0:58:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很快关于克莱拉的事就会传播开来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word's going to get out about Clara.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.16,0:58:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家会醒悟 然后让这个疯狂的暗杀游戏继续进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The public's going to wake up and find this mental assassination game going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.62,0:58:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很快我们就会收到另一具尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and soon we're going to have another body.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.64,0:58:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们应该怎么做 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what do we do? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.47,0:58:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完全被封锁了  瞎了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're totally locked out. Totally blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.78,0:58:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能发现他们是怎么入侵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can work out how they got in,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我或许能进行反向工程 夺回控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to reverse engineer some means of getting control back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.70,0:58:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人工智能蜂有命令日志吗 它们体内有缓存吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do the ADIs have a command log, on-board cache?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.68,0:58:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有 但加密了 - 我需要密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but that's encrypted. - I'll need the key to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.12,0:59:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我调查了员工档案 找到了些犯罪嫌疑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been through the employee files, found some POIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.28,0:59:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.49,0:59:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要参与对颗粒企划员工的审讯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sitting in on these? Granular interviews?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.98,0:59:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是去别处待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.10,0:59:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是7点15分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 7:15.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.81,0:59:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,三件死亡案件与社交媒体上流行的话题标签有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three deaths have now been linked to a hashtag circulating on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,充满争议性的新闻评论员乔·鲍尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Controversial journalist Jo Powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.71,0:59:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好  你发话题标签了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. Have you posted the hashtag?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.23,0:59:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的 还是都市传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it real or an urban myth?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.43,0:59:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,上千人参入其中 他们是否也有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thousands have been taking part, but how culpable are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.03,0:59:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都有人死亡 我们想听听你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are dying, and we want to hear your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.50,0:59:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,七号线 利亚娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Line seven, Liana...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.36,0:59:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的 这真的在发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is real, this is happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.66,0:59:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了我很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am happy to see her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.90,0:59:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是话题标签杀了他们  这只是个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the hashtag killing them. That's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.66,0:59:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是个混蛋 那你活该被羞辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, if you're an arsehole, you deserve to be shamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.27,1:00:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 五号线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, line five.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.54,1:00:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想说的是 总有人排在第一位 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but my point is, someone's gotta be top of the list, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.18,1:00:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以为什么不让那些罪有应得的人排在第一位 比如种族主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why not make it someone, you know, who deserves it, like a racist.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.62,1:00:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在这标签后 我看到过名人 政客 每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the hashtag, I've seen celebrities, politicians, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.98,1:00:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这不代表你要鼓励人们参与其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't mean you have to sit there encouraging people to take part.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.85,1:00:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是这件事已经发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is this is already happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.86,1:00:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而且群众都知道他们可以参与其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people know that they can jump onboard
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.34,1:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没人知道他们做没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because nobody will ever know if they did or didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.74,1:00:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 先暂停争论 我们来看看前五名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's just pause for a moment and go back to that top five.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.66,1:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,正如之前所说 第一名是首相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we have been saying, the Chancellor is at number one,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.04,1:00:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让大家好好考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want us to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.78,1:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这正向我们反映了人民的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that tell us about the choice of the nation?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.31,1:00:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他排第一 其实也没有很惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can't say I'm surprised that he's number one on the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.90,1:00:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经有一段时间很不受欢迎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been pretty unpopular for quite a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.22,1:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是因此 他就应该排在第一名吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does that warrant his place on this list?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.62,1:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我是觉得 在这件事情上 人们不用想太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying people don't have to think too hard about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.42,1:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他是第一名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's he's number one,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.58,1:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这会形成更多讨论 可能还会有更多人投他的票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that should generate more discussions and probably more votes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你抽时间来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.82,1:01:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是没找到吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No good? - No good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.02,1:01:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这真厉害 - 肖恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's all fascinating... - Shaun.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.86,1:01:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但我们打算什么时候关闭它 - 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But when do we shut it down? - Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.24,1:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我怀疑你司的基本能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me for being sceptical about your agency's basic competence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.34,1:01:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 汤姆 - 我现在他妈的是砧板上的肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tom. - I'm on the fucking chopping block here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.82,1:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,名单上的第一名  人民的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number one on the list. The people's fucking choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.47,1:01:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,法林顿排在第四 他可是个恋童癖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farrington's number four, and he's a paedophile.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.54,1:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他被怀疑是恋童癖 - 他就是  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Suspected paedophile. - He did it. You know he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.23,1:02:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快关掉它  所有的社交媒体  整个网络 结束掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just shut it down. All social media. The whole bloody Internet, pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就今天一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for today,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.07,1:02:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,至少等到拇指姑娘施展出才华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at least until Thumbelina here pulls his finger out
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.50,1:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的抓到人为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he actually catches someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.99,1:02:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不建议关闭社交媒体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't advise shutting things down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.51,1:02:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是我们可以  我们能做到不是吗 - 整个社交媒体吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But it's possible? We can do that? - The whole of social media?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.37,1:02:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对  弄得跟朝鲜一样 - 从技术上讲 是可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Pull a North Korea on it. - Well, yes, technically.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.74,1:02:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就关掉 - 这不是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right, so push the off switch. - That's not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.59,1:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗 - 我觉得不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No? - Not in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.14,1:02:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 作为一个即将被攻击的对象 我请求把它关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, okay. It's just that speaking as a marked man, I beg to fucking differ.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.07,1:02:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们关掉社交媒体 你还是排名第一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we shut it down, you'll still be number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.04,1:02:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且肯定会是第一名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guaranteed to be, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.40,1:02:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他是对的  如果我们让它继续运行 起码还有几个小时时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right. If we let it run on, at least there's a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.34,1:02:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在五点前 任何事都可能发生  投票结果可能会改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything could happen before five o'clock. The vote might change.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.22,1:02:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但也有可能不会  报告怎么说  那份档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and it might not. What about that report? The archive job?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.42,1:02:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,1985年 提到法林顿的那份备忘录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From 1985, that memo about Farrington?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.87,1:02:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但那与这件事毫不相关 - 泄露它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was over an unrelated matter. - Leak it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆 那就是诽谤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom, that would be a smear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.44,1:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也希望是 那只是彻底的诽谤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A head-to-toe shit smear, I fucking hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.55,1:02:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经80岁了  已经活够了  快让他去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in his 80s. He's had his life. Fuck him under the bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.22,1:02:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我能提出一个替代方案吗  我们把你转移到一个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could suggest an alternative? We move you to a safe location.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.56,1:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 保证你五点前是安全的 - 昨天你不也这么做了 很有效啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you secured before five. - Worked out well for you last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.48,1:03:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.02,1:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是泰丝·沃伦德  她是大三学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This next one's Tess Wallender. She was a junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.42,1:03:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以没有多少专业技能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So not much in the way of technical skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.34,1:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因个人原因退出颗粒企划 - 神经衰弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quit Granular for personal reasons. - Nervous exhaustion, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.67,1:03:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在人力资源部门工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worked in Human Resources for Granular until she quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.62,1:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她拍了油管上一名男子的照片 说他骚扰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took a photo of a guy on the Tube, said he'd harassed her,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.02,1:03:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,下流评论什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lewd comments or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.22,1:03:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,结果他有学习障碍 所以她不断地侮辱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned out he had a learning disability so she caught a ton of shit on...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.74,1:03:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在社交媒体上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On social media.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.62,1:03:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是卡琳·帕克探员 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. I'm DCI Karin Parke. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就像整个天气系统都与我作对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like having a whole weather system turn against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.08,1:04:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一条接着一条的憎恨消息 日以继夜地不断涌进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hate message after hate message, around the clock, all piling on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.95,1:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很难讲清楚 他们对我的情感带来了什么影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to describe what that does to your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.66,1:04:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,突然间 无数你看不见的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly there's a million invisible people,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.21,1:04:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,全都在谈论他们多鄙视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all talking about how they despise you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.42,1:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这感觉像精神病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a mental illness.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.07,1:04:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.36,1:04:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.71,1:04:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,卧槽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.28,1:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我认输了 我犯错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, hands up, I made a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是人们喜欢对我穷追猛打这一点 让我很受打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the way people enjoyed kicking me, that's what got to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.58,1:05:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这对他们来说只是一时的乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The casual fun they had and, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.62,1:05:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我不能继续活下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just felt I couldn't go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.02,1:05:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谁救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who found you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.85,1:05:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 加勒特 我的室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... Garrett, my flatmate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.11,1:05:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我割腕的五分钟后 在浴室里发现了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He found me in the bath five minutes after I'd slashed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.72,1:05:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这很疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.22,1:05:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经半昏迷了 他把我拖出浴缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm half-conscious. He's dragging me out of the bath,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.80,1:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他滚 说 “我没穿衣服”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm telling him to get out, saying, "I'm naked."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.81,1:05:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我手腕上绑了毛巾 让我保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tied towels 'round my wrists, kept me conscious,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.94,1:05:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,直到救护车来 他都在抚摸我的头发 和我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kept stroking my hair till the ambulance arrived, talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.80,1:05:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.80,1:05:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他一直对我有感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he always had a thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.06,1:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在同一个地方工作 所以你懂的 尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we worked at the same place so, you know... awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.16,1:05:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他也在颗粒企划公司工作吗 - 对  他是人工智能蜂项目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He worked at Granular? - Yeah. On the ADI thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是个神童  特别聪明 - 你说他叫什么来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was a real wunderkind. Ultra-smart. - What did you say his name was?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.60,1:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,加勒特  加勒特·斯科尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garrett. Garrett Scholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.90,1:06:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,加勒特·斯科尔斯  我们要找到加勒特的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garrett Scholes. We need the whereabouts of a Garrett...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.60,1:06:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科尔斯  我们正要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scholes. We were about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这被藏在乔·宝维斯脑子里找到那只蜜蜂的缓存里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was buried in the on-board memory of the Jo Powers' ADI.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.27,1:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 一份声明  98页的声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was? - A manifesto. A 98-page manifesto.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.15,1:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个  还有一张该死的自拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And check this out. There's fucking selfies in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.53,1:06:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以开始了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're good to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.14,1:06:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就是这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's the charge in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.16,1:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好  撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Pull back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.43,1:07:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都已就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all set here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.19,1:07:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detonate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.88,1:07:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是 我们把你转移到一座地下碉堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the plan is, we move you to an underground bunker,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.02,1:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,炸毁方圆十公里内的每一个蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knock out every hive within a ten-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.60,1:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢 把我留在那吗  要多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, what, just leave me there? How long for?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.11,1:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是临时方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a temporary measure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.96,1:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要多久来解决所有蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long till you take out all the hives?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.35,1:07:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有2万到3万个蜂巢  要耗费两年时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 20,000, 30,000 of them. That would take two years.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.86,1:07:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,两年 一天一个受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years, a victim a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.76,1:07:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 对环境的影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More to the point, the environmental impact would...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.65,1:07:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.23,1:07:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,卧槽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.39,1:07:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.84,1:07:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.16,1:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,往后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.58,1:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.20,1:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我操 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For fuck's sake, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你有备用计划吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your Plan B?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.81,1:08:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他在最初的员工名单上 但我们无视了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was on the original employee roster, but we discounted him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.15,1:08:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他六个月前出国了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left the country six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.42,1:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为我们在找附近的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we were looking for someone nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.32,1:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细调查他  找到所有能找到的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run a full trace on him. Everything we can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.03,1:08:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有生产价值的疯子 这是最糟的一种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lunatic with production values, that's the worst kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.40,1:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,“感谢科技革命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thanks to the technological revolution,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.57,1:09:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,使我们有权利去愤怒去指责 可以不计后果地发泄愤怒”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have the power to rage and accuse, spout bile without consequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.58,1:09:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只有当我们被迫认识到科技赋予我们的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only by being forced to recognize the power technology grants us,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.00,1:09:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,认识到个体所承载的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to acknowledge individual responsibility..."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.30,1:09:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是这种玩意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it all like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.08,1:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他把人们比作昆虫 说人们在实施残忍中得到快感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likens the population to insects, says we revel in cruelty,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.12,1:09:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是由人性的恶产生的致命弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it's a weakness that should be bred out of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.72,1:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他近些天来所说的主题 都是要让人们承担自己的言行所带来的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recurrent theme is he wants people to face the consequences of what they say and do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.92,1:09:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 强迫他们去承担 - 所以这一切都是道德训诫吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wants to force that on them. - The whole thing's a moral lesson?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.12,1:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他想让我们发现这个真相 再传播出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted us to find this and spread it about.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.42,1:09:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.26,1:09:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.97,1:10:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.95,1:10:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卡琳  卡琳  他露出破绽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karin. Karin. He's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他是自己写的这份文件 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's put this document together himself, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.46,1:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他本人的名字在元数据里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His author name's in the metadata.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.02,1:10:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他抹掉了所有其他信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he stripped out everything else,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.12,1:10:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们就不知道他什么时候写的这本书 没错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we don't know when he's written it, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.62,1:10:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,书中大部分的图片都是网上的剪贴画 除了这一张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the photos are clipart off the Internet, except this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.56,1:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 自拍 - 这就是他的漏洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The selfie. - That's where he's screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.01,1:11:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他用自己的手机拍了自拍 照片上就会有手机留下的地理标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taken it with his phone, and the phone left a geotag on the image.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.45,1:11:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以你就能知道他是在哪里拍的自拍 - 我能知道精确的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you know where he took this? - I know precisely where.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.22,1:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里 颗粒企划的总部在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here and Granular HQ is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.72,1:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 武装警察 待在原地 - 武装警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Armed police! Stay down! - Armed police!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.90,1:12:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,武装警察  待在原地  武装警察  站出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed police! Stay where you are! Armed police! Show yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.04,1:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.22,1:12:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,去左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.26,1:12:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有发现 - 没有发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear! - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.68,1:12:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.90,1:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,典型的有钱名人作风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lifestyles of the rich and famous.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.94,1:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看这儿  熔炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. The forge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.50,1:13:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.18,1:13:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我在证据科接触的一半物证都是有烧焦痕迹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half the drives I sifted in forensics had scorch marks on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.42,1:13:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么看 - 看起来像是他的工具包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think? - Yeah. Looks like his toolkit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.15,1:13:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会用吗 - 这就像是开门的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can use it? - Pretty much the key to the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.04,1:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你能重新控制它们吗  发送停用指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can get control back? Send the deactivation?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.53,1:14:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了他的源代码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got his source code.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.67,1:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我应该能逼他现身 - 动作快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should be able to bounce him out. - Be quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.31,1:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,开门的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key to the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.23,1:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙可不像是那种会把这么重要的证据双手奉上的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our guy doesn't seem the type to leave keys lying around.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.89,1:14:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.04,1:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  解除系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Deactivate her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.50,1:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要修复权限 - 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I need to repair permissions. - Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.12,1:14:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.89,1:14:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's weird?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.04,1:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间不多了 - 那个文件  之前不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Time's ticking. - That file. Wasn't there before.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.62,1:14:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This file? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.62,1:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布鲁  - 我觉得是移动设备识别码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blue? - I think they're IMEI numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.42,1:14:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.56,1:14:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,每台手机 每个设备都有一串特殊的号码 移动设备识别码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every phone, every device has a unique number, an IMEI number.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.27,1:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,每串号码都与一个特定的用户相关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tethers it to a unique user.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.51,1:15:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我可以查一下 就是反向追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - But I can check, just... reverse lookup.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.85,1:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.82,1:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人都是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.65,1:15:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  这里有38万7千人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. There's 387,000 of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.62,1:15:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你们的蜜蜂收集来的资料吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are these IDs your spooks have been collecting?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.35,1:15:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不  你准备好了吗 - 是的 差不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! Are you ready yet? - Yeah, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.54,1:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.68,1:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那个老师叫什么来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the name of that teacher? Hate cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莉莎  莉莎·巴哈尔 - 莉莎·巴哈尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Liza. Liza Bahar. - Liza Bahar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.68,1:15:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.53,1:15:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一份使用过死亡标签的人的名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a list of everyone who's used the hashtag.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.84,1:15:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.68,1:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有参与过报应游戏的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone who took part in the Game of Consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.19,1:15:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子他们是从国家通信总部搜集了这些人的身份信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've hoovered up their ID from GCHQ by the looks of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.70,1:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你设的后门给他提供了方便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That backdoor worked both ways, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.22,1:15:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看一下有没有我的名字 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See if I'm on there. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.60,1:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前发布了这个标签 加上斯科尔斯的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I posted the tag earlier with Scholes' face.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.45,1:15:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是为了看看他会有什么反应 - 好 好 差不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just trying to get a reaction from him. - Yeah, yeah, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.86,1:15:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 有你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.68,1:15:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.46,1:16:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么要搜集参与过这个游戏的人 我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why has he collected everyone who took part? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.87,1:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.83,1:16:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 快开始运行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - Run it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.12,1:16:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你们想想看  他是在给我们下套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Think. He left us a trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.15,1:16:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 那张带有位置的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, come on. - That photo with the whereabouts,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.21,1:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他根本不会犯这种错误  他知道我们会追踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's too big a mistake for him. He knew we'd do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.69,1:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我们现在就关掉它 好吗 - 也许这会引发这个游戏的最后一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now we're shutting it down, all right? - And maybe that'll trigger some endgame,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.31,1:16:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可能和这个名单有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something to do with that list.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.88,1:16:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会这些人才是他的真正目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if those are his real targets?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.06,1:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这名单上的所有人  所有参与过这个游戏的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people on the list. Everyone who took part.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.44,1:16:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,报应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.13,1:16:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那些仇恨人物都只是诱饵  玩家才是最终目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hate figures were the bait. The players are the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.55,1:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 启动失效指令 - 再等等 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run the deact command. - Now just wait a minute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.15,1:16:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马上启动 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run it. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.04,1:17:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.06,1:17:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.60,1:17:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我必须得这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, but that needed doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.18,1:17:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 不 不 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, no, no, no. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.48,1:17:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.57,1:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fuck! - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.90,1:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.90,1:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.48,1:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.56,1:22:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都很熟悉接下来的惨剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all tragically familiar with the rest of the events of that week.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡人数数目之大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we need no reminding of the sheer scale
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.44,1:22:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,亦无需多言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the loss of life that followed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.92,1:22:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.50,1:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔森小姐后来怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what became of Ms. Colson?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.92,1:23:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为她非常自责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she blamed herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.04,1:23:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I know she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.67,1:23:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得是她的追查导致了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She felt she'd followed his breadcrumb trail and sprung the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.69,1:23:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她辞职了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left the force.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.70,1:23:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经很久没有她的消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.65,1:23:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着给她打电话 发邮件 但是都没有回音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rang her, tried emailing, but no response.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.88,1:23:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.32,1:23:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大约四个月之后 他们在一处海滩找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About four months later, they found her things.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.61,1:23:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她的个人物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.29,1:24:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,和一封遗书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a note.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.31,1:24:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She killed herself?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.77,1:24:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 可以这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the base theory, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.91,1:24:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,帕克小姐 请你随时待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Parke, I would like to commend you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.44,1:24:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如有需要 我会传唤你上庭并提供证词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for sharing your testimony and your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.83,1:24:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.67,1:24:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.76,1:26:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Señor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.30,1:26:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gracias. - Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《为国所恨》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(5月15日  第一天)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(新提醒)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(死贱人)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(乔·鲍尔斯 = 人渣)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(你是在开玩笑吗 尊重点别人 祝你下半生都坐在轮椅上度过 乔·鲍尔斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(我看了格温的书 至少她还做了点什么 而不是到处攻击别人 不尊重别人)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(你就是彻头彻尾的垃圾  乔·鲍尔斯 你该觉得羞耻)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(你个毫无同情心的贱人)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,(你有超过200条新提醒  其中96条提到你)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(问：该给恶心的东西起什么名字？ 答：乔·鲍尔斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(乔·鲍尔斯 你妈的)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(恶心的贱人)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(去死吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(贱人中的贱人)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(来看看  警察封锁了乔·鲍里斯房子的周围  他们不可能活捉她)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(有消息称警察在乔·鲍里斯住处  希望他们因为她的言论逮捕她)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(乔·鲍尔特)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(贱人 婊子)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(滚蛋 荡妇 死 杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(实话说  乔·鲍尔斯这婊子要是被杀了 我做梦都会笑醒)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(签署请愿书！ 立刻解雇)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(乔·鲍尔斯死于火灾)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(乔·鲍尔斯这荡妇该死)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(滚回家吧图斯克  图斯克死期到了)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(垃圾 恶心  那个小孩真是太可爱了  图斯克说唱)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.22,0:27:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(第三天)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.34,0:39:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(去死吧 图斯克)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.50,0:42:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(讨厌你 你应该被吊死)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.66,0:42:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(人渣中的人渣)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.86,0:42:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,(去死吧克莱拉·米德斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.42,0:42:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,(克莱拉·米德斯 什么鬼？！)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.62,0:42:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(他们为你的自由而战死)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.34,0:42:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(你妈的)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.30,0:46:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(追踪中)
